	(text "  CC1200 VHF 144 MHz Matching Network\n  Source: TI CC1120EM 169 MHz ref design (TIDR220/TIDR222)\n  Scaled from 169 MHz to 144 MHz band.\n  No official TI reference exists for CC1200 at 136-160 MHz.\n\n  WARNING: VHF values are starting points only.\n  VNA tuning required during board bring-up.\n\n  Topology identical to UHF (3-path, shared SMA):\n    TX: PA → C2-L1-C1-L2-C3-L3-C4 → C10(DC block) → SMA\n    TRX: TRX_SW → C3 to TX path, L5 to balun center\n    RX: LNA_P/N differential balun (L6, L7, L8, C8, C9)\n    PA bias: AVDD → R6(22Ω) → L4 → PA, C5 bypass\n\n  Inductors larger than UHF (lower freq = more L).\n  PLL loop filter C18 = 1.8 nF (vs 1.5 nF UHF).\n  All other values (crystal, RBIAS, DCPL, bypass) same as UHF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.314 64.516 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
